*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PAY0009
*> PURPOSE : PAYROLL DEDUCTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-05-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 624
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PAYNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0009.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PAY0009C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 BENEFIT-IND        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 PENSION-RATE       PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 4000-BENEFITS
    PERFORM 4100-PENSION
    DISPLAY "BENEFIT-IND=" BENEFIT-IND
    DISPLAY "PENSION-RATE=" PENSION-RATE
    STOP RUN.
4000-BENEFITS.
    *> BENEFITS ELIGIBILITY
    IF IN-EMP-TYPE = 'F'
       OR (IN-EMP-TYPE EQUAL TO 'P' AND IN-WEEK-HOURS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 30)
        MOVE 'Y' TO BENEFIT-IND
    END-IF.
4100-PENSION.
    *> PENSION CONTRIBUTION RATE
    IF IN-PENSION-OPTIN = 'Y'
       AND IN-SERVICE-YEARS NOT < 3
        MOVE 0.0500 TO PENSION-RATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0300 TO PENSION-RATE
    END-IF.
